Description: Cross-platform control center for AJAZZ devices
 AJAZZ Control Center is a desktop application for AJAZZ and Mirabox HID
 devices: stream-deck-style key panels (AKP153 / AKP153E / AKP03 / AKP05),
 VIA-compatible and Microdia-chipset keyboards (AK820 Pro, AK980 PRO, AK
 series), and AJ-line mice. It provides a Qt-based GUI for binding keys,
 encoders and mouse buttons to multi-step action chains (key macros, URLs,
 plugin actions), managing folder pages, importing / exporting profile
 bundles, and a system-tray quick-switcher.
 .
 The udev rule shipped with this package grants user-level device access via
 TAG+="uaccess" - no group membership and no logout required.
